INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the current environment and my status, my primary goal is to ensure my survival. The environment is harsh, with heavy snow and a high danger level due to the risk of avalanche. My immediate priorities are to find shelter, warmth, and food. First, I will seek out a small rock overhang as it can provide some protection from the elements. Because my body temperature is normal but can quickly drop in such cold conditions, I need to find a way to stay warm. I will gather some moss and lichens, not only as a food source but also to help insulate my body. For water, I can collect snow and melt it to stay hydrated. I should also stay alert for any signs of mountain goats, as they could indicate a source of food or safe paths. My injury and illness levels are concerning, so I need to be cautious with my energy expenditure and avoid risky actions that could worsen my condition. I will document these experiences in my diary to build my understanding and plan further actions."
}

