INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "Given the environment and my current state, I need to prioritize finding a way to stay hydrated and warm, as well as find food and shelter. My body temperature is currently fine, but the cold temperature could pose a risk over time. Since snow can be melted for water, I can collect snow and find a way to melt it, possibly by using any heat source I might find or create. My hunger level is high, and since food is scarce, I need to explore the area carefully for any edible vegetation, like the mentioned moss and lichens, or consider hunting if I learn how to do so. Shelter is vital to protect against the moderate danger level, so I will use the small rock overhang for now. I need to consider my energy and overall health levels and plan my actions accordingly to conserve energy while addressing immediate survival needs."
}

