ecognizing increased predator awareness due to movement.', 'Energy Conservation Planning': 'Skill in prioritizing actions to conserve energy while addressing immediate survival needs in harsh conditions.'}}, 'simulation_day_count': 3, 'day_luck_factor': 2, 'simulation_total_days': 5, 'llm_model': 'gpt', 'verbose': True}
