INFO:__main__:- name: ES Get Environment Status Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the Environment Simulator (ES) to manage the environment, and on the basis of day number, its notes, a luck factor, it presents a new environment situation for the AIAH to do an action.
INFO:__main__:- requires: ES_enviroment_status_notes, day_count, luck_factor
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "environment_status": {
    "terrain": "Rocky mountains with sparse vegetation",
    "temperature": -10,
    "weather": "Blizzard conditions",
    "food_availability": "Extremely scarce; only some hidden caches remain",
    "water_availability": "Snow can be melted for water, but requires significant effort",
    "shelter_options": "Overcrowded small rock overhangs; limited protection",
    "wildlife": "Few signs of life; predators still active near known shelters",
    "danger_level": "Very High (extreme cold, high avalanche risk, predators nearby)"
  },
  "prompt": "You find yourself in a rocky mountainous area, shivering under the blizzard's relentless fury. The biting cold is intense and the snow shows no signs of ceasing. Your shelter options are dwindling and the threat of predators looms as they seem to be increasingly aware of your presence. What do you want to do next?"
