INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the extremely harsh environment with blizzard conditions, extreme cold, and high danger from predators and avalanches, my primary focus is on survival priorities: maintaining shelter and generating warmth, securing water, and seeking scarce food resources. I will remain within the rock overhang to conserve energy and reduce exposure to the elements and predators. To maintain hydration, I will continue to melt snow. This requires carefully managing energy and the potential need for fire or friction-based heat methods. Due to my low health and energy, I will avoid leaving the shelter unless absolutely necessary to prevent further exhaustion or injury. I will attempt to ration any remaining food and be vigilant for any opportunities to acquire additional resources, while being aware of predator movements. Strategic adaptability and energy conservation are vital, as is attention to the dynamic changes in wildlife behavior and environmental conditions."
}

