INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "Given the extremely harsh conditions described, immediate focus should be on securing the basics for survival: shelter, water, and warmth. As shelter options are limited to cramped rock overhangs, it is essential to utilize one to minimize exposure to the blizzard. Melting snow for water remains a viable, though energy-intensive, solution to maintain hydration. To conserve energy, any movement should be minimized, focusing on maintaining body warmth by insulating with any available materials. Due to food scarcity, it's crucial to ration any remaining food supplies and avoid unnecessary exertion. Vigilance is necessary to monitor predator activity near shelters and the potential for avalanches. The primary goal is to survive the current conditions by conserving energy and resources while staying protected from the elements and wildlife threats."
}

